# Copy this file to .env and adjust for local development.
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code.

# Relative on purpose — the dev server proxies /api/* to the local API
# (see vite.config.ts) and production serves both through the same nginx
# origin, so the browser never makes a cross-origin request. See
# docs/architecture/authentication.md ("Cookie policy") for why that
# matters for session cookies. Point this at an absolute URL only if you
# are deliberately testing a cross-origin deployment.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
